=2 Walkthrough
=3 If all Wings of the Goddess missions are complete
* Examine the ??? next to one of the {p:Cavernous Maws|Cavernous Maw} in {z:Batallia Downs}, {z:Rolanberry Fields} or {z:Sauromugue Champaign} for a cutscene.

=3 If you have not completed all Wings of the Goddess missions
* You must be on or past Wings of the Goddess mission 8 {M:In the Name of the Father|In the Name of the Father|In the Name of the Father} to progress further.
* Zone into {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} for a cutscene. You can use a Home Point, Survival Guide, Retrace, or Instant Retrace.
** You will receive a {@k} {k:Lightsworm}.
** It is possible you might have received this Key Item through previous quests, make sure to check your Key Items.
** If you do not receive the above cutscene, visit one of the Cavernous Maws in either {z:Batallia Downs}, {z:Rolanberry Fields}, or {z:Sauromugue Champaign} and click on the sparkling blue ??? on the ground next to it for a cutscene first. Then return to {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} for the above cutscene.
** If you have done all of the above and have not progressed to the next mission ({M:Sacrifice|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-17|Sacrifice}), interact with the {p:Mystic Retriever} in {z:Southern San d'Oria (S)} (M-6).
* You will then be on {M:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-17|Rhapsodies of Vanadiel Mission 2-17|Sacrifice}

=3 Notes
* Lilisette will not be available if you are currently undertaking one of the following Wings of the Goddess missions:

{M:On Thin Ice|On Thin Ice|On Thin Ice} / {M:Proof of Valor|Proof of Valor|Proof of Valor} / {M:A Sanguinary Prelude|A Sanguinary Prelude|A Sanguinary Prelude} / {M:Dungeons and Dancers|Dungeons and Dancers|Dungeons and Dancers} / {M:Distorter of Time|Distorter of Time|Distorter of Time} / {M:The Will of the World|The Will of the World|The Will of the World} / {M:Adieu, Lilisette|Adieu, Lilisette|Adieu, Lilisette} / {M:By the Fading Light|By the Fading Light|By the Fading Light} / {M:Edge of Existence|Edge of Existence|Edge of Existence} / {M:Her Memories|Her Memories|Her Memories} / {M:Forget Me Not|Forget Me Not|Forget Me Not} / {M:Pillar of Hope|Pillar of Hope|Pillar of Hope} / {M:Glimmer of Life|Glimmer of Life|Glimmer of Life} / {M:Time Slips Away|Time Slips Away|Time Slips Away} / {M:When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide|When Wills Collide} / {M:Whispers of Dawn|Whispers of Dawn|Whispers of Dawn} / {M:Where It All Began|Where It All Began|Where It All Began}* / {M:A Token of Troth|A Token of Troth|A Token of Troth}* / {M:Lest We Forget|Lest We Forget|Lest We Forget}*
* If you start the mission {M:Where It All Began|Where It All Began|Where It All Began} by completing {M:Maiden of the Dusk|Maiden of the Dusk|Maiden of the Dusk}, you must finish the Wings of the Goddess storyline, {q:Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn|Champion of the Dawn}, and {q:A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion|A Forbidden Reunion} to continue.
* If you are stuck without a {k:Lightsworm}, go to the Goblin Footprint in {z:Batallia Downs (S)} at F-9 and watch all of the Ganged Up On cutscenes , and then wait a game day. After that check the shimmering ??? next to any of the present day maws in {z:Rolanberry Fields}, {z:Sauromugue Champaign}, or {z:Batallia Downs} to get the option to raise your {k:Lightsworm}.
* You will receive the message "The bonds tying you to Altana have strengthened, enabling you to experience all the memories of Wings of the Goddess!"

* If you are missing the {i:Cipher of Lilisette's alter ego II|Cipher: Lilisette II|10171} you will not be able to progress. You can retrieve it from the Mystic Retriever (M-6) in {z:Southern Sandoria (S)|Southern San d'Oria (S)} near the Mog House.

